        <mxCell id="legend" value="LEGEND — colour carries meaning&lt;br&gt;stick figure · a person (Owner, Member, Athlete)&lt;br&gt;violet dashed · a machine actor with its own credential&lt;br&gt;blue · a client surface a person holds&lt;br&gt;grey dashed · an external system (FCM, Google, GitHub, Ollama)&lt;br&gt;amber · the public edge (the only published port)&lt;br&gt;orange · scheduled or automated work (n8n, cron, CI)&lt;br&gt;green · an API process or module (backend, worker)&lt;br&gt;rose cylinder · a server store or volume&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;violet open arrow · a person or machine uses a surface&lt;br&gt;solid arrow · a synchronous call (HTTP, driver, function)&lt;br&gt;grey dashed · INFERRED, not traced to a file&lt;br&gt;rose open arrow · data read or written&lt;br&gt;green dashed arrow · an event, push or change stream (asynchronous)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="80" width="230" height="217" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
