        <mxCell id="legend" value="LEGEND — colour carries meaning&lt;br&gt;white · a step in a flow&lt;br&gt;rose cylinder · a server store or volume&lt;br&gt;green dashed process · a domain event or outbox row&lt;br&gt;green · an API process or module (backend, worker)&lt;br&gt;teal · a bounded context (owns its own collections)&lt;br&gt;orange · scheduled or automated work (n8n, cron, CI)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;rose open arrow · data read or written&lt;br&gt;green dashed arrow · an event, push or change stream (asynchronous)&lt;br&gt;solid arrow · a synchronous call (HTTP, driver, function)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1760" y="80" width="230" height="165" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
