        <mxCell id="n-gates" value="Each phase is its own spec-kit feature on its own branch and lands only when its gate passes with recorded output. Amber = in progress; pale = specified. Gates: P1 refresh reuse revokes the family · P2 airplane-mode alarm fires · P3 Cairo and Berlin each fire once at their 22:00 · P4 Stop within 1 s · P5 weekly × 6 with one skip = 5 · P6 Wednesday 21:30 shows Friday · P7 3-video playlist → 3 done · P8 no allergen in 50 generations · P9 panel edit on the phone under 10 s · P10 every admin action audited · P11 restore drill + 7 days ok." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="320" width="1400" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
